OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fevening and night with the best of the
OL,7,Fclear spells over Banff and Moray.
OL,8,FCloudier over parts of southern
OL,9,FAberdeenshire, the odd shower mainly
OL,10,Falong the coast. Minimum Temperature
OL,11,F2C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA mainly dry morning,
OL,14,Fbrightest in north. Then showers
OL,15,Fgradually pushing in, more frequent
OL,16,Fover Aberdeenshire, on a moderate
OL,17,Fsoutheasterly breeze. Maximum
OL,18,FTemperature 8C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
